SENTINEL Obstacle Runner README
-------------------------------

Welcome to the game Obstacle Runner!
It is based on a game available for the Arduino and the TEC-1.
I don't know which one is the original.
The TEC-1 version was written by Brian Chiha in 2020.
I have completely rewritten the game.
To start the game enter "OR" at the prompt and press ENTER.
The display reads "OBSTACLE RUNNER". Press any key to begin.

You are a runner.
Obstacles are coming towards you from the right.
Press the ENTER key to jump over the obstacles.

Your score is displayed at the rightmost top display position.
You are awarded 1 point for every obstacle.
The score is given in hexadecimal notation.

If an obstacle hits you, the game ends.
"OUCH!" and your final score is displayed.
Press ESC to quit the game or any other key to restart.

